  "description": "Operating Area: Turkey, Greece\n\nStep onto Perla Del Mar and experience the warmth of a handcrafted wooden gulet designed for relaxed, effortless living at sea. Cruising along the turquoise coast, you’ll feel the blend of traditional craftsmanship and modern comfort from the moment you settle in.\n\nThis is a yacht built for those who appreciate quiet bays, good company, and the simple pleasure of being on the water. With spacious cabins, thoughtful design touches, and a dedicated crew who know how to make your holiday feel easy, every day becomes something to look forward to.\n\nWhether you spend your time swimming in secluded coves, wandering ashore to explore, or stretching out on deck under the Mediterranean sun, Perla Del Mar offers a setting that feels both personal and unforgettable — a place where time slows down and the journey becomes the memory. Perla Del Mar is also available in the Greek Islands for 16 guests.",
